cer and energy infrastructure company dedicated to powering the future. We own and operate approximately 13.1 GW of power infrastructure in the United States, including 2.2 GW of nuclear power and a significant dispatchable fossil fleet. We produce and sell electricity, capacity, and ancillary services into wholesale U.S. power markets, with our generation fleet principally located in the Mid-Atlantic, Ohio, and Montana. Our team is committed to generating power safely and reliably and delivering the most value per megawatt produced. Talen is also powering the digital infrastructure revolution. We are well-positioned to serve this growing industry, as artificial intelligence data centers increasingly demand more reliable power.","zh":"Talen 是一家領先的獨立電力生產商和能源基礎設施公司，致力於為未來提供動力。我們在美國擁有並營運約 13.1 吉瓦的電力基礎設施，其中包括 2.2 吉瓦的核電和大量可調度的化石燃料發電群。我們生產並向美國電力批發市場銷售電力、容量和輔助服務，我們的發電艦隊主要位於大西洋中部、俄亥俄州和蒙大拿州。我們的團隊致力於安全可靠地發電，並實現每兆瓦發電的最大價值。 Talen 也為數位基礎設施革命提供動力。隨著人工智慧資料中心日益需要更可靠的電力，我們已做好充分準備來服務這個不斷發展的產業。"},{"en":"Highly efficient baseload generation. We own and operate over 5.7 GW of low- and zero-carbon baseload generation, including a 90% interest in, the 2.5 GW Susquehanna facility, the seventh largest nuclear-powered generation facility in the U.S. In 2025, we produced approximately 17 TWh of reliable, zero-carbon power from Susquehanna at a low all-in cost of approximately $27 per MWh, while also maintaining excellent safety and operational performance (when measured by standards adopted by the nuclear industry). While Susquehanna has typically comprised approximately half of our total annual generation, we recently added an additional 2.8 GW of low-carbon generation—the equivalent of more than the entire Susquehanna plant—through our recent acquisitions of Freedom and Guernsey, which are some of the new newest, most highly-efficient H-class combined-cycle baseload natural gas facilities in ","zh":"高效率的基本負載生成。我們擁有並營運超過 5.7 吉瓦的低碳和零碳基本負載發電，其中包括 2.5 吉瓦薩斯奎哈納設施 90% 的權益，該設施是美國第七大核發電設施。到 2025 年，我們以每兆瓦時約 27 美元的低總成本從薩斯奎哈納生產約 17 太瓦時可靠的零碳電力，同時還保持出色的安全性和運營性能（按照採用的標準衡量）由核工業）。雖然薩斯奎哈納發電量通常約佔我們年發電總量的一半，但我們最近透過收購 Freedom 和 Guernsey 額外增加了 2.8 吉瓦的低碳發電量，相當於整個薩斯奎哈納工廠的發電量，這兩個工廠是美國最新、最高效的 H 級聯合循環基本負載天然氣設施。"},{"en":"Our baseload fleet has historically generated revenues primarily from energy sales into the PJM wholesale market, PJM capacity sales, and strategic hedging; however, as discussed further below, in June 2025, we and AWS entered into an expanded power purchase agreement for the long-term, fixed-price supply of up to 1,920 MW of power annually from Susquehanna to the adjacent AWS data center campus through 2042. See \"—Our Key Markets and Revenue Streams—Contracted Revenues—AWS PPA\" for additional information. The success of this arrangement opens up contractable opportunities for other assets under our \"Talen flywheel\" strategy. See \"—Our Strategies—Combine the above strengths to execute on our \"Talen flywheel\" strategy\" for additional information.","zh":"我們的基本負載船隊歷來主要透過 PJM 批發市場的能源銷售、PJM 容量銷售和戰略對沖產生收入；然而，如下文進一步討論的，我們和 AWS 於 2025 年 6 月簽訂了一項擴大購電協議，每年從 Susquehanna 向鄰近的 AWS 資料中心園區提供高達 1,920 MW 1,920 MW 的長期固定價格。有關更多資訊，請參閱“—我們的主要市場和收入來源—合約收入—AWS PPA”。這項安排的成功為我們的「Talen Flywheel」策略下的其他資產開闢了可承包的機會。有關更多資訊，請參閱“—我們的策略—結合上述優勢來執行我們的“Talen 飛輪”戰略”。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[],"competition":[],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"PJM","val":2477000000,"zh":"PJM"},{"name":"All Other Segments","val":161000000,"zh":"所有其他部門"}],"total":2581000000},"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Energy & Other","val":2141000000,"zh":"Energy & Other"},{"name":"Electricity Sales & Ancillary Services","val":1940000000,"zh":"電力銷售及輔助服務"},{"name":"Operating Revenue Capacity","val":485000000,"zh":"營業收入能力"},{"name":"Physical Electricity Sales Bilateral Contracts Other","val":93000000,"zh":"實體售電 雙邊合約 其他"}],"total":2581000000}},"peers":["VST","CEG","LEU","NNE","BWXT"]}}